WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.649
Jocotán plot, read by a computer voice.

2
00:00:02.899 --> 00:00:07.729
Soil: repeats. The satellite saw 2 months of bare soil.

3
00:00:07.979 --> 00:00:12.359
Burning: repeats. Fires seen nearby in 3 of 15 years.

4
00:00:12.609 --> 00:00:18.503
Midsummer drought: watch. Dry spells longer than 15 days in 2 of 25 years.

5
00:00:18.753 --> 00:00:22.681
There are two even options: maize with jack bean or sorghum with cowpea.

6
00:00:22.931 --> 00:00:25.984
This is not an official notice: talk it over with your extension worker.
